  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Pro Tour Control is a precision-oriented pentagonal co-polyester string featuring Thermo Fusion Technology (TFT) and a pre-stretched construction to minimize tension loss and extend durability. Designed for advanced players who prioritize control, consistency and directional accuracy, it combines outstanding tension maintenance with excellent spin potential. The 1.23 mm version emphasizes feel and responsiveness, while the 1.28 mm version delivers greater stability and durability for demanding tournament play.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Pro Tour Control 是一款采用五边形截面设计的高性能共聚酯球线，使用 Thermo Fusion Technology（TFT 热融合技术）进行预拉伸处理，可有效降低掉磅并延长使用寿命。它专为追求精准控制、稳定表现和优秀保磅能力的竞技球员设计，在提供高旋转潜力的同时保持极高的方向控制。1.23毫米版本更强调手感与响应；1.28毫米版本则更偏向耐久、稳定和比赛表现。"
  },

